Third-party code attribution
============================

`src/rime_schema_compare/call_librime.py` is derived from the
`call_librime.py` module in the librime-bert-gram project (or equivalent
upstream). Retain the original license and copyright from that file when
distributing.

Vendor Rime configurations are Git submodules under `vendor/` and are licensed
under their respective repositories (rime-frost, rime-ice, rime_wanxiang).

The upstream Luna Pinyin snapshot under `vendor/mingyuepinyin/` includes
rime/rime-luna-pinyin, rime/rime-prelude, rime/rime-essay and rime/rime-stroke.
Source revisions are recorded in `upstream_versions.json`; original licenses
and available author lists are preserved under its `licenses/` directory.
